sion control for pi-coding-agent. [...] | Level | Description | Allowed Operations | | --- | --- | --- | | **minimal** | Read-only (default) | `cat`, `ls`, `\nSource: permission-pi (https://registry.npmjs.org/permission-pi)","results":[{"title":"gotgenes/pi-permission-system","url":"https://github.com/gotgenes/pi-permission-system","snippet":""},{"title":"rHedBull/pi-permissions","url":"https://github.com/rHedBull/pi-permissions","snippet":""},{"title":"jayshah5696/pi-agent-extensions","url":"https://github.com/jayshah5696/pi-agent-extensions/","snippet":""},{"title":"packages/coding-agent/docs/packages.md at main · earendil-works/pi","url":"https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono/blob/main/packages/coding-agent/docs/packages.md","snippet":""},{"title":"VTSTech/pi-coding-agent","url":"https://github.com/VTSTech/pi-coding-agent","snippet":""},{"title":"MasuRii/pi-permission-system - GitHub","url":"https://github.com/MasuRii/pi-permission-system","snippet":""},{"title":"agents/pi/extensions/security.ts at main · michalvavra/agents","url":"https://github.com/michalvavra/agents/blob/main/agents/pi/extensions/security.ts","snippet":""},{"title":"README.md at main · discountry/safe-coder","url":"https://github.com/discountry/safe-coder/blob/main/README.md","snippet":""},{"title":"pi-permission-system","url":"https://registry.npmjs.org/pi-permission-system","snippet":""},{"title":"permission-pi","url":"https://registry.npmjs.org/permission-pi","snippet":""}],"error":null,"provider":"exa"}]},"id":"23b4dd66","parentId":"7f0b9cab","timestamp":"2026-05-16T13:01:10.430Z"}
